Equations (1)\[Dash](3): one neuron and the logistic sigmoid; (4)\[Dash](5): \
a layer in matrix form and in batch form; (6)\[Dash](7): a network; \
(8)\[Dash](10): losses and softmax; (11)\[Dash](13): backpropagation; (14): \
gradient descent; (15): the Celsius\[Dash]Fahrenheit neuron; (16)\[Dash](17): \
the cart-pole and its teacher; (18): a pendulum and its energy; (19): Adam.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"1e165f3e-25a7-4056-a4d0-7f706ea30564"],

Cell["\<\
Figures 1\[Dash]3: AND and OR, the XOR network, the hidden layer; Figure 4: \
training XOR (Manipulate) and Figure 5 (animation); Figure 6: the walk over \
the loss (Manipulate); Figure 7: learning to balance a stick (Manipulate); \
