Theorem 1: XOR is not linearly separable; Theorem 2: universal approximation; \
Theorem 3: backpropagation; Theorem 4: a learned force law conserves energy.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ff0ba141-9d64-4389-b16d-8efb31c11f65"],

