Cell["\<\
Two layers solve it. XOR is true when OR is true and NAND (not both) is true, \
and each of these is one neuron. So a hidden layer with an OR neuron and a \
NAND neuron, followed by an AND neuron, computes\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a7f6a1d8-c3c1-4ec8-b82d-86cc5f4f8973"],

