Cell["\<\
Diagram 4. The trained balancing network. The thickest lines leave \[Theta] \
and \[Omega]: the tilt of the stick and how fast it is falling matter most, \
as for a person balancing a broom.\
\>", "Caption",
 FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
 FontSize->14,ExpressionUUID->"49ac39e2-420a-48f2-9534-dee0b62d96e0"],

